  userData: "Created with built-in ImageGen. Prompt: Use case: logo-brand. Asset type: One small 2D Unity UI icon for a cozy LO-FI game's purring-sound button. Input image 1 is a style reference ONLY: its warm ivory color and simple rounded line language, not its wind subject. Create a friendly sleepy KITTEN FACE icon, front-facing, with two softly pointed ears, a rounded head, two closed smiling eyes, a tiny nose and a short pair of whiskers on each side. Use a few clean bold warm-ivory strokes, consistent thickness and rounded ends, matching the reference icon family. It must remain immediately recognizable when displayed at 32 to 48 pixels. Center the single kitten face inside a square 1:1 canvas with a balanced transparent margin. Flat clean monochrome raster icon, restrained cozy charm. Genuine transparent alpha everywhere except the ivory icon strokes; no background square, no circle badge, no gradient backdrop, no glow, no room, no body, no extra cats, no text or letters, no watermark."
